{'symbol': 'BLK', 'date': '2022-12-21 07:50:00', 'title': 'BLACKROCK® CANADA ANNOUNCES ESTIMATED DECEMBER CASH DISTRIBUTIONS FOR THE ISHARES® ETFS', 'text': 'TORONTO, DEC. 21, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- BLACKROCK ASSET MANAGEMENT CANADA LIMITED (“BLACKROCK CANADA”), AN INDIRECT, WHOLLY-OWNED SUBSIDIARY OF BLACKROCK, INC. (NYSE: BLK), TODAY ANNOUNCED THE ESTIMATED DECEMBER CASH DISTRIBUTIONS FOR THE ISHARES ETFS LISTED ON THE TSX OR NEO. UNITHOLDERS OF RECORD OF A FUND ON DECEMBER 30, 2022 WILL RECEIVE CASH DISTRIBUTIONS PAYABLE IN RESPECT OF THAT FUND ON JANUARY 5, 2023.'}